ned or controlled by the United States within the following-described area, comprising 10,252.76 acres, more or less, in Canyon County, Idaho, be, and they are hereby, reserved and set apart for the use of the Department of Agriculture, subject to valid existing rights, as a refuge and breeding ground for migratory birds and other wildlife: Provided, That any private lands within the area described shall become a part of the refuge hereby established upon the acquisition of title thereto or lease thereof by the United States:","original_source":{"page_or_item":"American Presidency Project web page (transcription; not an official edition); APP node 371759; common-crawl capture 2025-10-17T14:44:15Z; unnumbered paragraph 1","sha256":"68a6e263c69d80e49080e2bb0b8038e5abfe49d06028b9aa1f9e600b645f6ea2","url":"https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/executive-order-7655-establishing-deer-flat-migratory-waterfowl-refuge-idaho"},"scope_id":"EO:7655#p1","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Most of the above-described lands have been withdrawn for use in connection with the Deer Flat Reclamation Project and are primarily under the jurisdiction of the Department of the Interior; and the reservation herein made of such lands shall be subject to the use thereof by the said Department for reclamation work and Incidental purposes.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"American Presidency Project web page (transcription; not an official edition); APP node 371759; common-crawl capture 2025-10-17T14:44:15Z; unnumbered paragraph 2","sha256":"68a6e263c69d80e49080e2bb0b8038e5abfe49d06028b9aa1f9e600b645f6ea2","url":"https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/executive-order-7655-establishing-deer-flat-migratory-waterfowl-refuge-idaho"},"scope_id":"EO:7655#p2","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Executive Order No. 1032 of February 25, 1909, i